@Inventory_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ürünler + stok (AvailableStock / ReservedStock)
GET {{Inventory_HostAddress}}/products

### Tek ürün
GET {{Inventory_HostAddress}}/products/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Tüm rezervasyonlar (Reserved / Released / Rejected)
GET {{Inventory_HostAddress}}/reservations

### Bir siparişin rezervasyonu
GET {{Inventory_HostAddress}}/reservations?orderId={{orderId}}

### Sağlık
GET {{Inventory_HostAddress}}/health
